    "tactics": "Goblins use hit-and-run tactics. They fire arrows from cover using superior numbers, then use Nimble Escape to retreat when enemies close. Shield-wielding goblins protect archers.",
    "attacksNotes": "<p>Scimitar [Combat]: Melee attack (Agil 5 + Melee Combat 2), Reach: 5 ft</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Margin 1:</strong>: 7 damage (5 + 2 Str)</li>\n<li><strong>Margin 2:</strong> 7 damage, DR halved (round up)</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Shortbow [Combat]: Ranged attack (Dex 4 + Ranged Combat 1), Range: 80/320 ft 1 success = 8 damage (4 + 4 Dex) (short range) 2 successes = 8 damage, DR halved (round up)</p>",
    "specialAbilitiesNotes": "<p>Nimble Escape: Can take Disengage or Hide as a [Minor] action instead of a standard action. Pack ### Tactics: When an ally is within 5 feet of the target, subtract 1 from both attack dice.</p>",
    "reactionsNotes": "<p>Shield Block: When hit by melee attack, choose one: Attacker must reroll one of their success dice Gain +2 DR against this attack only</p>",
